Allocation:
<% allocation.drifts.each do |drift| -%>
  <%= drift.target.label %>: <%= drift_summary(drift) %>
<% end -%>
<% if allocation.drifts.empty? -%>
  no targets measured
<% end -%>
Cash drag: <%= cash_drag_summary(allocation.cash_drag, current: allocation.cash_drag_current?) %><% if allocation.cash_drag_current? && allocation.cash_drag.flagged %>: FLAGGED, <%= cash_drag_flag(allocation.cash_drag) %><% end %>.
<% if allocation.flagged.any? -%>
Diversifiers moving with SPY (above <%= allocation.threshold %>): <%= correlation_list(allocation.flagged).to_sentence %>. The diversification assumption is failing for these right now.
<% end -%>
<% if allocation.correlations.any? -%>
Correlation with SPY, <%= correlation_heading(allocation.correlations, current: allocation.correlations_current?) %>: <%= correlation_list(allocation.correlations).join(", ") %>
<% end -%>
<% if allocation.unmeasured.any? -%>
Not measured: <%= unmeasured_list(allocation.unmeasured) %>
<% end -%>
Fund flow: <%= fund_flow_summary(allocation.fund_flow) %>
